# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values. .env is never committed (see .gitignore).
#
# MailerLite API key. Used only by `npm run mailerlite` on this computer, to list your groups and
# field keys. The live sign-up form uses the same key from the Apps Script's Script properties
# (MAILERLITE_API_KEY), never from this file.
#
# The participant page is static HTML: browsers cannot read .env, and a key put in config.js or any
# other file the page loads would be readable by everyone who opens it.

MAILERLITE_API_KEY=
